{"id":"629012","name":"驴打滚","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/629012/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"红豆沙","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄豆粉(熟)","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"碗中倒入糯米粉。","img":"images/629012/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入两匙糖。","img":"images/629012/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入温开水搅拌至酸奶状。","img":"images/629012/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入少量的玉米油。","img":"images/629012/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"充分搅拌均匀。","img":"images/629012/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备一个盘子，刷上油。","img":"images/629012/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把粉浆倒入盘中。","img":"images/629012/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，扎几个小孔透气。","img":"images/629012/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入微波炉。","img":"images/629012/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"因为我家的微波炉是小功率的，所以时间用了6分钟，如果大功率的微波炉只需4分钟就够了。","img":"images/629012/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"时间到取出，把糯米糍翻个面，面里没有白心，说明已完全熟了。","img":"images/629012/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"准备红豆沙和炒黄豆粉。","img":"images/629012/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"案板上先撒上黄豆粉，放入糯米团。","img":"images/629012/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"表面再撒上黄豆粉。","img":"images/629012/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"用擀面杖擀开。","img":"images/629012/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入豆沙。","img":"images/629012/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"用刮刀刮平整。","img":"images/629012/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"差不多就这样吧。😁","img":"images/629012/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"从底部卷起。","img":"images/629012/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"继续撒上黄豆粉。","img":"images/629012/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"取一根线，从底部穿过。","img":"images/629012/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"交叉拉紧，由此来切断，比刀用的更利索。","img":"images/629012/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"切好的驴打滚。","img":"images/629012/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"把边角废料先解决掉，好吃。","img":"images/629012/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"成品。甜滋滋，糯叽叽，老祖宗留下的手艺就是香！","img":"images/629012/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：微波炉\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}